### MSS301 Restaurant/Food - IntelliJ HTTP Client collection
### Start Restaurant (8081), Food (8082), then Gateway (8080).
### Run database/SEED_CATEGORIES_OPTIONAL.sql and replace IDs below with real IDs.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@restaurantDirect = http://localhost:8081
@foodDirect = http://localhost:8082
@restaurantId = 1
@foodId = 1

### 1. List categories through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/categories?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create restaurant (R04 ISO-8601 form)
POST {{gateway}}/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "BBQ Hoa Lac",
  "owner": "ABC Company",
  "priceFrom": 2000,
  "priceTo": 3000,
  "phone": "01234567890",
  "address": "Hoa Lac Park",
  "openDate": "2026-03-14T10:00:00Z",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 3. Get restaurant detail
GET {{gateway}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Partially update restaurant: omitted fields stay unchanged
PUT {{gateway}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "owner": "New Owner Company",
  "priceTo": 3500
}

### 5. Filter restaurant list
GET {{gateway}}/api/restaurants?page=0&size=10&name=BBQ&ownerName=Owner
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create food; restaurantId is checked through OpenFeign
POST {{gateway}}/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Pho Bo",
  "price": 50000,
  "ingredients": "Beef, rice noodle, herbs",
  "restaurantId": {{restaurantId}},
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7. Get FoodResponseDTO detail with nested RestaurantDTO
GET {{gateway}}/api/foods/{{foodId}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Partially update food
PUT {{gateway}}/api/foods/{{foodId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "price": 55000,
  "ingredients": "Beef, rice noodle, herbs, onion"
}

### 9. Filter FoodListDTO
GET {{gateway}}/api/foods?page=0&size=10&name=Pho&ingredients=beef
Accept: application/json

### 10. Deactivate food
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/foods/{{foodId}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Deactivate restaurant
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Expected status=4 / HTTP 400 for a missing restaurant
GET {{gateway}}/api/restaurants/999999
Accept: application/json

### 13. Direct-service URL for debugging gateway-independent behavior
GET {{restaurantDirect}}/api/categories?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 14. Direct Food service health-by-API check
GET {{foodDirect}}/api/foods?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
